    6 │ 	await (ctx.db.query("messages") satisfies object).filter((q) => q.eq(q.field("read"), false)).collect();
  
  i The database reads every document in the query before .filter() drops the ones that don't match, so the query gets slower as the table grows.
  
  i Use .withIndex() to read only the matching documents, or collect the results and filter them in your code.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

